{"id":"u-1ca7b00b-51cf-4944-8d70-ced9c677c200","src":"community","title":"Hypertrophie program, U/L","author":"Marcus  G.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/l874xW-hypertrophie-program-ul-pplxup-ppl","desc":"This program is designed for dedicated lifters who want to train every day, without compromising recovery or results. Using a classic Upper/Lower split, this plan lets you hit each muscle group frequently with the right balance of volume and intensity, so you grow stronger and bigger week after week.\n\nWith no mandatory rest days, this split gives you the flexibility to stay active daily and align your training with your lifestyle. Each session is structured to manage fatigue by alternating muscle groups, ensuring you recover properly even while training 7 days a week if you choose.\n\nWhy it works:\n✅ Progressive Overload: Built to steadily increase weight, reps, or performance every week.\n✅ Flexible Frequency: Train daily — or take a rest day anytime you feel you need it.\n✅ Balanced Volume & Intensity: Enough work to grow, without overtraining.\n✅ Sustainable Progress: Smart programming that respects recovery through smart muscle group rotation.\n\nWhether your goal is to build size, strength, or just stay active every day, this Upper/Lower split keeps you moving forward, consistently, sustainably, and with purpose.\n\nTrain daily. Recover smart. Progress forever.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:12:12.120Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper A","Lower A","Upper B","Lower B","Upper A","Lower A","Upper B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Low To High Fly","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Preacher Curl","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":9}]},{"n":"Reverse Pec Deck","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)